<title>UK: GEC says electronics &amp; defence market tough.</title>
<headline>GEC says electronics &amp; defence market tough.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Electric Co Plc said in its results statement on Tuesday that market conditions in its key defence and electronics division GEC-Marconi were set to &quot;remain difficult&quot; but demand for its products was seen holding up.</p>
<p>Annual operating profits at the unit, set to become the heart of GEC's business under its strategic shake-up, rose 18.6 percent to 362 million stg with sales up 12.2 percent to 3.5 billion stg.</p>
</text>
